{"title":"2014 OIM Problems/Problem 6","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#See_also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See also</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Side_note\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Side note</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_OIM_Problems/Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Given a set <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/a/4/6a47ca0fe7cb276abc022af6ac88ddae1a9d6894.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$X$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"18\" height=\"14\" /> and a function <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/2/3/723465660b665a457c075dd9017c094e22678425.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f: X \\to X$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"89\" height=\"18\" />, we say that for each <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/0/5/805adb67e19c27850f15dc11d7cbaf8748f9459e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x \\in X$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"48\" height=\"13\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/d/8/5d876709128ff01eeb85ae96a29e7ead51afaea0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f^1(x)=f(x)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"101\" height=\"19\" />, and for each <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/9/1/e917cc69cebd38d3d32b6957b20f692588cb2e2f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$j \\ge 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"41\" height=\"16\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/8/8/d88dd865e212e7d8816bdd05ef2f7b9f903bf0fe.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f^{j+1}=f(f^j(x))$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"128\" height=\"22\" />.  We say that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/9/6/396150ce5dfce53dced188c0bd97d98304b70c3b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a \\in X$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"50\" height=\"15\" /> is a fixed point of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/b/2/bb2c93730dbb48558bb3c4738c956c4e8f816437.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"13\" height=\"18\" /> if <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/5/b/d5b1947e743beab136cd7378781c373b38264f22.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(a) = a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"70\" height=\"20\" />. For each real number <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" />, we define <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/f/e/5fe74925ffdea4d77d24c11d49d49e5f86601103.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\pi (x)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"37\" height=\"20\" /> as the number of smaller positive primes less or equal to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" />. Given a positive integer <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" />, we say that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/4/b/34bba444eb2e954150b91bae6a9ac074892103f4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f : \\left\\{1, 2, \\cdots , n\\right\\} \\to \\left\\{1, 2, c\\dots , n\\right\\}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"262\" height=\"20\" />\nit's \"<i>catracha</i>\" if <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/5/4/1549ee56c299bcb22c3a23e1beafce472ed78d88.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f^{f(k)}(k)=k$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"95\" height=\"20\" /> for all <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/f/7/cf73fffd2623492f2ecd8c416f21f8b97b0c7f8e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$k \\in \\left\\{ 1,2,\\cdots,n\\right\\}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"133\" height=\"20\" />  Prove:\n</p><p>1. If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/b/2/bb2c93730dbb48558bb3c4738c956c4e8f816437.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"13\" height=\"18\" /> is <i>catracha</i>, then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/b/2/bb2c93730dbb48558bb3c4738c956c4e8f816437.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"13\" height=\"18\" /> has at least <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/5/a/b5ae51149bb7f595f185dba8fa2660eb1dcba8aa.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\pi (x)-\\pi (\\sqrt{x})+1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"142\" height=\"22\" /> fixed points\n</p><p>2. If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/e/8/0e82b8ca3d23836cdb9ee9877631135c7f892349.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n\\ge36$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"55\" height=\"16\" />, there exist a <i>catracha</i> function with exactly <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/5/a/b5ae51149bb7f595f185dba8fa2660eb1dcba8aa.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\pi (x)-\\pi (\\sqrt{x})+1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"142\" height=\"22\" /> fixed points\n</p><p>~translated into English by Tomas Diaz. ~orders@tomasdiaz.com\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_OIM_Problems/Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><i>This problem needs a solution. If you have a solution for it, please help us out by <span class=\"plainlinks\"><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/index.php?title=2014_OIM_Problems/Problem_6&amp;action=edit\">adding it</a></span>.</i> \n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_OIM_Problems/Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=OIM_Problems_and_Solutions\" title=\"OIM Problems and Solutions\">OIM Problems and Solutions</a>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Side_note\">Side note</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_OIM_Problems/Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Side note\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>\"<i>Catracha</i>\" is a fried tortilla, covered in fried beans and grated cheese, originating from Honduras.\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261017234915\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [show‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.017 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.028 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 125/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 423/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 4/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 3829/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    5.618      1 Template:Solution\n100.00%    5.618      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:26275:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261017234915 and revision id 207408. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}